wherein the oral care composition is effective for fluoride uptake in teeth such that it provides an enamel fluoride concentration increase of at least 1200 ppm, as assessed by Fluoride Uptake Study, FDA monograph evaluation (FDA Method #40) while simultaneously providing tartar control activity.

